    Point { x, y }
    {"code": "E0222", "severity": "error", "message": "field shorthand `y` is not allowed", "file": "err/habits.bmb", "line": 48, "col": 20, "end_line": 48, "end_col": 21, "fix": {"message": "write `y: y`", "replacement": "y: y"}}

Everything else the program prints must stay as it is.

